<h1 class="mb-4">{{ title }}</h1>
<p class="lead">
    Welcome to the Go-Looking Glass!
</p>
<p>
    Like other network looking glasses this system allows you to send ICMP pings
    or perform a traceroute to any host using IPv4 or IPv6. Unlike some other
    looking glasses it also produces reports with a unique URL that can be shared
    with your colleagues or friends. It's also deliberately designed to be 'simple'
    and is not a fully-fledged network looking glass with BGP functionality. To get
    started, click one of the links above.
</p>
<p>
    This installation is running version {{ version }} of go-lg, a piece of free
    and open-source software available on
    <a href="https://github.com/CHTJonas/go-lg">GitHub</a>.
</p>
<p>
    You might also like the following tools:
</p>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://bgp.tools/">bgp.tools</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://mtr.tools/">mtr.tools</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://ping.pe/">ping.pe</a></li>
    <li><a href="http://ping.online.net/">ping.online.net</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.host-tracker.com/en/ic/check-http">Host Tracker</a></li>
    <li><a href="http://www.dns-lg.com/">DNS-lg</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://dnsviz.net/">DNSViz</a></li>
</ul>
